      "source": [
        "####\n",
        "- Sentence 1:StandardScaler transforms each numeric feature so that it has a mean of 0 and a standard deviation of 1, which changes the original units into standardized z-scores.  \n",
        "- Sentence 2:This is useful before training ML models because it prevents features with large numeric ranges from dominating the learning process compared to smaller-range features.  "
      ]
    },
